rule: BROAD_EXCEPT_ADDED
issue: 419
title: Route B - a template edit no longer holds an assertion swallowed by a broad except at warn
origin: #419 ruling Q1 (b), Q5 (b) (issuecomment-6170353038): broad_except_in_test_pos plus a comment edit
origin2: in an existing template. A broad except in a test has no unit, so opaque-change evidence was
origin3: the only credit it could take (row36_file_scoped_no_sibling_evidence_pos); a Python test now
origin4: refuses it.
